| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | string, a credential; dynamic | unset: `[using default] OPENAI_API_KEY = <hidden>` | an API key | `models/openai_compatible.py`, through its `api_key_env` argument, whose default this is; `tests/integration/test_committed_secrets_gate.py` takes the name from `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `OPENAI_API_KEY` row | Authenticates the OpenAI-compatible adapter; a caller may name another variable only when config/project.json `models.credential_env.openai-compatible` lists it. | the headless adapter's key: `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | always |
